# proto-file: proto/stipulator/v1/records.proto
# proto-message: stipulator.v1.Gap

requirement_id: "REQ-impl-native-frame"
reason: "Clause-scoped mapped-region, full-width access, permission, alias, spill/reload, reachable-successor, return-context, ownership and refusal examples support the conditional native frame checker, including seven default-optimized field kernels. The connected value/frame checker additionally checks actual argument marshaling, one direct CALL, its callee and RET to the immediate decoded continuation, deriving complete callee-written stack results from separate value premises and full-width memory access proofs under an explicit SSE2 model. Complete invariant evidence across all four clauses remains outstanding: bounded access, spill and short-search fuzz grammars, sampled concrete byte-memory/value oracles sharing instruction decoding, and sampled GNU decoder-boundary comparisons do not establish the complete accepted region/interface, instruction-effect, call/primitive accounting or refusal and composition-boundary conjunction. The byte-frame checker deliberately refuses calls; the connected checker refuses nested calls and unsupported CPU dispatch. Syscalls, reachable loops, AVX, PUSH/POP and unresolved forms remain unsupported. This is an uncovered evidence obligation, not a demonstrated implementation contradiction; neither local checker establishes source-call association, source-layout correspondence, ordinary-Go lifting, clock/vDSO or harness semantics, an enclosing caller result or runtime-reuse authority."
content_hash: "fc289b43666044f9b054c0e6597d3466e6e3db521a25ea280ec799a3bfe7a908"
source_hash: "b8006c227e563682f091ed7c3767ce9d68607b833e0cde294d3340b377228cc9"
lands { manual { condition: "tooling-redesign 5.1w.2b.3b.3: establish complete conditional native-frame invariant evidence for the supported byte-region and instruction model, including explicit memory lifetimes and aliases, actual image permissions, full-width bounds and checked arithmetic, byte-level pointer provenance under overlapping writes, every reachable successor, original return context, protected state, immutable dependencies and bounded/cancelled refusal. Discharge actual-use, ordinary-Go lifting/suspension and harness premises separately in this same composition slot; selected callee and primitive frame extensions remain at 5.1w.3b, with producing/current/historical applicability at 5.1w.2b.4." } }
excuses: GAP_EXCUSE_UNCOVERED
